Security considerations:
References to projects, files, or conversations may reveal private
identifiers or contextual information when shared. Resolving an untrusted
reference could expose private resources or trigger unintended behavior
in a handler. A full security analysis is not yet available because the
syntax and resolution behavior have not been finalized. This registration
request makes no claim that a URI is trustworthy or grants access rights.